# P12: the Morph step FX on Tracker+ (the plus panel: Pattern key, the list moves by tap Down as on the Mini).
# Pattern, Rec on, hold FX2 (Fx) for the FX list, Down to "Morph" (list position 47 on Tracker+ and Mini, FEATURE_SYNTH_PATCHFX), release:
# the step under the cursor gets the Morph FX at its default 50 (title bar "Morph: 50% to slot 1", no Patch FX next to it). Ends on the state read: expect peek lastUsedFx reads the list position of the Morph FX
title: Morph FX on Tracker+ (P12)
check: texts
pause: 80ms

tap Pattern
wait 1000ms
tap Rec
wait 600ms
press Fx
wait 1200ms
tap Down x47
wait 800ms
shot morphfx-list
release Fx
wait 800ms
expect text "Morph: 50% to slot 1"
tap Rec
wait 600ms
shot morphfx-step
expect peek lastUsedFx 47
